                <note rend="inline" type="source">423.11 L 23/328a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Peru</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gonzales</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-06-20T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 20, 1921—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>33. This Government has appointed Mr. Barton Smith Commissioner in Landreau
                    Arbitration. Inform Peruvian Government and ask for name of Peruvian
                    Commissioner.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
